 {id:79,title:"Goodwill of Western Missouri & Eastern Kansas — Job Assistance",category:"Career",icon:"◎",description:"Employment services may include job-search support, digital-skills training, essential-skills courses, reentry services, and other supports. Many services are free, but grant-funded programs may have eligibility rules.",tag:"Free job-search and employment support",region:"Kansas City region; service availability and eligibility vary by program.",contact:"Call or text 816-842-7425; confirm current walk-in hours and services.",url:"https://www.mokangoodwill.org/program-service/job-assistance"}
